
chown user file_name   --> to change user to file


chgrp group file_name   --> to change group to file


chown user:group file_name   --> to change both user & group to a file


chown user:group folder  --> to change for folder alone


chown user:group folder -R   --> to change for folder along with files in that folder


chown user:group folder/*  --> to change for files inside folder, not for folder
